=== cost-weight-balances
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Broker
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-02 buy
    Assets:Broker   10 AAPL @ 150.25 USD
    Assets:Bank   -1502.50 USD
--- out
Assets 10 AAPL
Assets -1502.50 USD
Assets:Bank -1502.50 USD
Assets:Broker 10 AAPL
=== cost-weight-unbalanced
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Broker
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-02 the amount alone does not balance
    Assets:Broker   10 AAPL @ 150.25 USD
    Assets:Bank   -10 AAPL
--- out
3: UNBALANCED
=== cost-elided-extends-scale
--- args
balance
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Broker
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-02 3 x 1.125 = 3.375, more decimals than USD is written with
    Assets:Broker   3 XYZ @ 1.125 USD
    Assets:Bank
2024-01-03 USD written with 2
    Assets:Bank   1.50 USD
    Assets:Broker -1.50 USD
--- out
Assets -3.375 USD
Assets 3 XYZ
Assets:Bank -1.875 USD
Assets:Broker -1.500 USD
Assets:Broker 3 XYZ
=== cost-decimals-multiply
--- args
register
Assets:Bank
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Broker
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-02 0.5 x 0.25 = 0.125
    Assets:Broker   0.5 GOLD @ 0.25 EUR
    Assets:Bank
--- out
2024-01-02 Assets:Bank -0.125 EUR -0.125 EUR
=== cost-register-shows-amount
--- args
register
Assets
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Broker
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-02 buy
    Assets:Broker   2 AAPL @ 100 USD
    Assets:Bank
--- out
2024-01-02 Assets:Broker 2 AAPL 2 AAPL
2024-01-02 Assets:Bank -200 USD -200 USD
=== value-basic
--- args
balance
--value
EUR
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets:Broker
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Equity
P 2024-01-01 AAPL 150.00 EUR
2024-01-02 opening
    Assets:Broker   4 AAPL
    Assets:Cash     20.00 EUR
    Equity         -4 AAPL
    Equity         -20.00 EUR
--- out
Assets 620.00 EUR
Assets:Broker 600.00 EUR
Assets:Cash 20.00 EUR
Equity -620.00 EUR
