=== value-rounding-half-away
--- args
balance
--value
EUR
--- in
P 2024-01-01 X 0.25 EUR
2024-01-01 open Long
2024-01-01 open Short
2024-01-02 0.5 x 0.25 = 0.125, at EUR scale 2: 0.13 and -0.13
    Long    0.5 X
    Short  -0.5 X
--- out
Long 0.13 EUR
Short -0.13 EUR
=== value-rounding-below-half
--- args
balance
--value
EUR
--- in
P 2024-01-01 X 0.9999 USD
P 2024-01-01 X 0.0041 EUR
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 0.1 x 0.0041 = 0.00041, at EUR scale 4: 0.0004
    A  0.1 X
    A  1.00 EUR
    B
--- out
A 1.0004 EUR
B -1.0004 EUR
=== value-parent-converts-own-total
--- args
balance
--value
EUR
--- in
P 2024-01-01 X 0.01 EUR
2024-01-01 open Assets:A
2024-01-01 open Assets:B
2024-01-01 open Equity
2024-01-02 each child rounds 0.005 to 0.01; the parent rounds 0.010 to 0.01
    Assets:A  0.5 X
    Assets:B  0.5 X
    Equity   -1 X
--- out
Assets 0.01 EUR
Assets:A 0.01 EUR
Assets:B 0.01 EUR
Equity -0.01 EUR
