=== assert-holds-and-fails
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 t
    A  10 EUR = 10 EUR
    B
2024-01-03 t
    A  -3 EUR = 7.00 EUR
    B
2024-01-04 t
    A  1 EUR = 7 EUR
    B
--- out
10: ASSERT_FAILED
=== assert-same-day-later-in-file
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-05 first in file
    A  10 EUR = 15 EUR
    B
2024-01-05 same day, later in file
    A  5 EUR
    B
--- out
OK
=== assert-same-txn-later-posting
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-05 the second A posting counts too
    A  10 EUR = 12 EUR
    A  2 EUR
    B
--- out
OK
=== assert-excludes-later-dates
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-06 dated after, written before
    A  100 EUR
    B
2024-01-05 the 100 is not counted yet, the 1 dated before is
    A  10 EUR = 11 EUR
    B
2024-01-04 dated before, written after
    A  1 EUR
    B
--- out
OK
=== assert-exact-account-only
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open Assets
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 children are not counted
    Assets:Cash  5 EUR
    Assets       1 EUR = 1 EUR
    B
--- out
OK
