=== assert-counts-stage3-transactions
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 Z not open, but A still gets the 5
    A  5 EUR
    Z
2024-01-03 the 5 counts
    A  1 EUR = 6 EUR
    B
--- out
5: NOT_OPEN
=== assert-ignores-unbalanced
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 unbalanced, contributes nothing
    A  5 EUR
    B  -4 EUR
2024-01-03 so A only has this 1
    A  1 EUR = 1 EUR
    B
--- out
3: UNBALANCED
=== assert-with-cost
--- args
check
--- in
2024-01-01 open A
2024-01-01 open B
2024-01-02 the asserted balance is in AAPL, not the cost currency
    A  3 AAPL @ 10 USD = 3 AAPL
    B
2024-01-03 t
    A  1 AAPL @ 10 USD = 30 USD
    B
--- out
7: ASSERT_FAILED
=== value-cost-and-prices
--- args
balance
--value
USD
--- in
P 2024-01-01 AAPL 150 USD
P 2024-06-01 AAPL 200.5 USD
2024-01-01 open Assets:Broker
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Equity
2024-01-01 * funding
    Assets:Bank   10000.00 USD
    Equity
2024-01-02 * buy
    Assets:Broker   10 AAPL @ 150 USD
    Assets:Bank
--- out
Assets 10505.00 USD
Assets:Bank 8500.00 USD
Assets:Broker 2005.00 USD
Equity -10000.00 USD
